    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "King Auctioneers are delighted to present to the market No. 4 Orchard Close, an\r\nimpressive three-bedroom family detached bungalow home, ideally positioned within\r\nthis small and exclusive development of just six properties off Athlone Road. Built in\r\n1980s and completely refurbished in 2017, this superb home is approximately 2000sq. ft., \r\nenjoys a B-rated BER: 103985446, designated off-street parking and a secluded rear garden.\r\nFinished to an exceptionally high standard, the property features triple glazed\r\nwindows, high-quality appliances and a wealth of bespoke finishes throughout. The\r\nproperty is exceptionally well proportioned with stylish contemporary interiors and a\r\nlight-filled sense of space.\r\n\r\nThe modern exterior comes with electric gates, exterior mailbox, nida gravel\r\ndriveway and granite footpath which finishes this low-maintenance front garden. The\r\nlarge, custom-built aluminium front door that opens into a bright and welcoming\r\nentrance hallway with generous storage. To the front is a beautifully appointed\r\nlounge featuring a gas fire with built in shelving. To the rear lies a large superb open-\r\nplan kitchen, dining and living space with floor-to-ceiling corner windows with electric\r\nblinds and patio doors opening directly onto the rear garden. This wonderful layout\r\ncreates a seamless connection between the indoor and outdoor living spaces and is\r\nideal for both family life and entertaining. The kitchen features an extensive range of\r\ncabinetry, a large central island, high-quality integrated appliances and a quartz\r\nworktop. A separate utility room is conveniently located off the kitchen and provides\r\nexcellent additional storage as well as plumbing for a washing machine and dryer.\r\nBedroom 1 is positioned off the main hall, with Bedroom 2 adjacent with built-in\r\nwardrobes. To the rear of the property is an exceptional principal suite. This\r\nimpressive dual-aspect bedroom enjoys wonderful natural light through the French\r\ndoors. A walk-in wardrobe area and ensuite shower room complete this superb suite.\r\nOutside, to the rear is a low-maintenance garden with raised beds which enjoys a\r\nhigh degree of privacy.\r\n\r\nThe location is exceptionally convenient, with a host of local amenities close by\r\nincluding Tesco, Aldi, pharmacies, cafés and local shops. The area is particularly\r\nwell suited to families, with the local primary school, GAA facilities, and public\r\ntransport all within short walking distance. No 4 Orchard Close offers excellent\r\nconnectivity via the M4 and M6 motorways. This exceptional turnkey home offers an\r\noutstanding opportunity for families seeking quality, space and well-designed\r\naccommodation with an exceptional location, high-quality specification and a\r\nwonderful outlook. \r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to appreciate all that this impressive property has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall 2.07m x 2.9m & 7.9m x 1.1m & 9.57 x 1.04m: \r\nTriple locking custom front door with glazed panel. laminate flooring, with hidden storage,\r\nskylights and sun tunnels. Attic access hatch. Wall light.\r\n\r\nLiving Room 5.55m x 4.15m: \r\nBright and spacious room with gas fire and blind on each window.\r\n\r\nDining Room: 3.4m x 4.3m, large corner window with electric blinds\r\n\r\nKitchen: 5.42m x 5.97m : Bespoke fitted kitchen, quarts worktop and splash back.\r\nGas hob, integrated extractor fan, Haier style fridge freezer, 8 x large saucepan\r\ndrawers. 2 x large hidden cutlery drawers. Integrated bin drawer. Integrated\r\ndishwasher. Integrated double neff oven and microwave and warming drawer.\r\nDurable quarts counter-tops. Kitchen Island with additional workspace and storage,\r\nhot water tap, garbage disposal.\r\n\r\nSnug 3.2m x 3.12m patio doors with electric blinds.\r\n\r\nUtility 2.16m x 2.6m wine fridge, sink, storage, stacked washing machine and\r\ntumble dryer. Door to back garden. Fuse box, heating control panel.\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom 3.11m x 3.43m: Tiled flooring and walls, bath, shower, Floating\r\nWHB with mirror with lighting and wall hung WC. Heated towel rail\r\nWall in Hot-press: 2.34m x 1.17m shelving, hot water tank and plumbing for solar\r\nhot water panels on roof.\r\n\r\nBedroom One 3.11m x 3.47m Laminate flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom Two 3.11m x 3.47 Laminate flooring and custom built wardrobes\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom: 3.9m x 3.84: Carpet with French doors to patio.\r\n\r\nMaster walk in wardrobe: 3.9m x 3.92m, bespoke built with glass on 2 panels and\r\nbuilt in shelves with jewellery drawers.\r\n\r\nMaster en-suite: 2.77m x 2.632m Fully tiled ensuite with wet room with high flow\r\nshower head, his and hers wash wall hung hand basin with under storage &amp; wall\r\nhung WC."
      },
